DESCRIPTION:Save the Date! Are you interested in gaining valuable insights
  into the professional opportunities that await you as a graduate student 
 at GSEHD? Join the Alumni Career Panel to hear directly from alumni about 
 their career journeys\, professional experiences\, and the pathways their 
 GSEHD degrees have helped them pursue. This conversation will highlight th
 e diverse career opportunities\, while offering practical advice on making
  the most of your graduate experience and preparing for your next professi
 onal step. Alumni joining us will include: Megan Ward - International Educ
 ation Josie Pemberton - Rehabilitation Counseling Mary Boehmer - Education
  Technology Leadership\nCategory: Alumni\nOriginal listing: https://calend
 ar.gwu.edu/event/gsehd-alumni-career-panel-fall26
